Description:
Innotron B.V. designs, develops, and realizes innovative custom electronic products for the industrial, consumer, ICT and medical markets.

Innotron acts as an electronic development partner for established and start-up companies. We perform all the steps required to take a product from a concept to a final reliable, high-quality, producible product that meets the customer's requirements.

Areas of expertise:
-	Analog design;
-	Digital design;
-	Mixed-signal design;
-	Power electronics design;
-	Embedded systems;
-	RF technology design.

Your partner in product development and electronics development


Embed designs custom electronics: hardware, embedded software and designs with FPGA. Customers approach Embed when they need the right embedded electronics and when standard solutions do not suffice. In an innovative, creative and flexible way Embed finds a turn-key solution. Our central focuses are meeting the wishes of the customer and designing high quality electronics. The projects Embed executes are very diverse; from sensors for navigation to high tech medical equipment and embedded industrial electronics


Embed
    highly educated engineers with training and experience;
    up-to-date understanding of the latest developments;
    quality products and meeting the customers requirements;
    flexible and creative;
    thinking along with the customer;
    structured and accurate approach;
    long term relationships with customers;
    investing in projects. 

Electronics hardware
    professional hardware design (schematic, layout);
    development of prototypes;
    coordination of production. 

Embedded software
    a structured and transparent approach;
    wide knowledge of programming languages;
    8 bit to 64 bit processors;
    embedded Linux. 

FPGA design
    VHDL;
    Altera;
    Xilinx.

Electrocel B.V. is opgericht op 28 februari 1975 en is sinds 28 mei 1993 een besloten vennootschap. 
Wij zijn BRL6000 gecertificeerd en erkend door Techniek Nederland en InstallQ. 
Daarnaast zijn wij erkend leerbedrijf.

Electrocel B.V. werkt met diverse strategische partners als één team aan de toekomst.

De werkwijze van Electrocel B.V. kenmerkt zich door een actieve en flexibele houding en een hoge kwaliteit van diensten. Hierdoor kunnen wij een groot aantal opdrachtgevers al vele jaren tot onze vaste klantenkring rekenen. 

Electrocel profileert zich in de volgende marktsegmenten:
- Domotica;
- Duurzaamheid;
- Videofoon- en intercominstallaties;
- Data- en communicatie-installaties;
- Brandmeldinstallaties;
- Inbraakmeldinstallaties;
- Kleinschalige nieuwbouw (villabouw);
- Services en onderhoud.

With decades of experience in the field of safe storage, LoQit a dutch 
OEM company,has developed a state-of-the-art electronic locking system. This fits perfectly with the requirements and wishes of today and tomorrow. A very user-friendly and intuitive high-tech platform for both users and administrators of locker systems aimed at making your business operations as efficient as possible. Regardless of what kind of industry you work in, LoQit will provide a customized solution for your business, with the possibility to integrate into your existing systems.

Developed in the Microsoft Azure platform the LoQit system is easy to adjust to the customer needs in times one technological development take place rapidly after another. Are your organizational needs changing? LoQit changes with you!

Our smart management platform makes lockermanagement easy. The manager can divide and configure the levels of accessibility the way he wants to. 

We made our LoQit electronic locking system even more user-friendly. From now on you can easily reserve, claim and open a locker by using your smartphone. LoQit developed a smartphone app for both IOS and Android. Easy to access with you Microsoft 365, Google or Apple account.

LoQit’s fields of application are multiple: 
-	Activity based workplaces;
-	Schools and universities;
-	End-of-trip facilities;
-	Cloakrooms;
-	Parcel delivery.

